import:
	../../../src/compiler_new/stage_01_discovery/discovery_builder:
		DiscoveryBuilder,
		empty_discovery_builder,
		find_name_id,
		name_id_index,
	../../../src/compiler_new/stage_01_discovery/intern_index: occupied_slot_count
	../../../src/compiler_new/stage_01_discovery/name_vocabulary:
		ALL_SEEDED_NAME_SPELLINGS,
		DEBUG_ONLY_NAME_INDEX,
		DISCARD_NAME_INDEX,
		NO_COPY_NAME_INDEX,
		REMOVED_INTO_NAME_INDEX,
		RESOURCE_RESULT_ORDINARY_NAME_INDEX,
		SEEDED_NAME_SPELLINGS,
		TAIL_RECURSIVE_NAME_INDEX,
		VOID_NAME_INDEX,
	test: TestSuite


---
The seeded vocabulary, pinned. Every spelling's position is its `NameId` in
every discovery name table, and the legacy adapter will assert this list
equals the existing compiler's synthesized vocabulary; changing the order or
the contents here is a deliberate id change.
---
